#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:5
#: 146a7da35cab4d59bcc2bcf51c1acdd9
msgid "Experienced users"
msgstr "Izkušeni uporabniki"

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:9
#: 1f9bbed20cf5465d9384452334706982
msgid "Use only following instructions if you know what you are doing... \"The management is not responsible for any case of [...]\" :D"
msgstr ""
"Navodila uporabljajte le, če veste, kaj počnete ... \"Vodstvo ni odgovorno "
"za noben primer [...]\" :D"

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:12
#: 73aa7121c47b43ce986562d44a72d14f
msgid "Adapt to your graphical chart"
msgstr "Prilagodite se svojemu grafičnemu grafikonu"

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:14
#: 3b8372bf5196483784a70dd21c9548bc
msgid "If you are comfortable with CSS stylesheets, you can adapt Galette CSS to fit your own colors. To achieve that, it is strongly discouraged to edit Galette CSS files, but rather the specific mechanism designed for that. Create a ``galette_local.css`` file in your ``webroot/themes/default`` directory with your styles, it will be automatically included."
msgstr ""
"Če vam je delo s slogovnimi predlogami CSS udobno, lahko prilagodite Galette "
"CSS svojim barvam. Da bi to dosegli, močno odsvetujemo urejanje datotek "
"Galette CSS, temveč uporabo posebnega mehanizma, ki je zasnovan za to. V "
"imeniku ``webroot/themes/default`` ustvarite datoteko ``galette_local.css`` "
"s svojimi slogi, ki bodo samodejno vključene."

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:16
#: 4c117cdc3e114fe59486d6e5fa1ff289
msgid "Try to keep things as simple as possible. For example, if you want to change association name color (displayed under pages titles), you will find in Galette the CSS rule `#asso_name` that defines several parameters including the color. Then, in your stylesheet, you will just need the following:"
msgstr ""
"Poskusite stvari čim bolj poenostaviti. Če želite na primer spremeniti barvo "
"imena asociacije (prikazanega pod naslovi strani), boste v Galette našli "
"pravilo CSS `#asso_name`, ki definira več parametrov, vključno z barvo. Nato "
"boste v svoji slogovni datoteki potrebovali le naslednje:"

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:24
#: 1e96e02eb7b34e39bd65c5c63a67501b
msgid "This will be enough to display your association name in red. Note that local CSS file and all issues it may cause will not be taken into account by the Galette team, no support will be provided."
msgstr ""
"To bo dovolj, da se ime vašega združenja prikaže rdeče. Upoštevajte, da "
"ekipa Galette ne bo upoštevala lokalne datoteke CSS in vseh težav, ki jih "
"lahko povzroči, zato vam ne bo zagotovljena nobena podpora."

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:26
#: fb6684b53601415f9a1227f60a605450
msgid "You also can override the print stylesheet, just create a ``galette_print_local.css`` file."
msgstr ""
"Slogovno tabelo za tiskanje lahko tudi prepišete, samo ustvarite datoteko "
"``galette_print_local.css``."

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:29
#: 0b370ab020e041978a129a9e9bd88e6b
msgid "Add and change strings"
msgstr "Dodajanje in spreminjanje nizov"

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:31
#: 790842fad86747e3a276e1e17ed66b6a
msgid "It is possible if needed to customize translated strings in Galette - without editing any Galette source file. Just create a ``galette_{mylang}_local_lang.php`` file (where `{mylang}` must be replaced with the language, like `fr_FR.utf8` or `en_US`) in the ``lang`` directory. This file must contains a simple PHP array with the original string (the one in Galette source code) as index."
msgstr ""
"Po potrebi je mogoče prilagoditi prevedene nize v Galette - brez urejanja "
"izvorne datoteke Galette. Samo ustvarite datoteko ``galette_{mylang}"
"_local_lang.php`` (kjer je treba `{mylang}` zamenjati z jezikom, kot je "
"`fr_FR.utf8` ali `en_US`) v imeniku ``lang``. Ta datoteka mora vsebovati "
"preprosto PHP tabelo z izvirnim nizom (tistim v izvorni kodi Galette) kot "
"indeksom."

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:33
#: d4b7b7d2e60e49d4903903a8941c6438
msgid "As example,  we want to change the \"Password\" string on the login page in french, translated as `Mot de passe :`. The original string is `Password:` (see ``galette/templates/default/pages/index.html.twig``), its french translation is `Mot de passe :` and we want to replace it with `Secret :`; so we will create the ``galette_fr_FR.utf8_local_lang.php`` with the following contents:"
msgstr ""
"Na primer, želimo spremeniti niz »Password« na prijavni strani v "
"francoščini, preveden kot `Mot de passe :`. Izvirni niz je `Password:` "
"(glejte ``galette/templates/default/pages/index.html.twig``), njegov "
"francoski prevod je `Mot de passe :` in ga želimo zamenjati s `Secret :`; "
"zato bomo ustvarili ``galette_fr_FR.utf8_local_lang.php`` z naslednjo "
"vsebino:"

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:41
#: 860fe6d76a224c0bba74e0bc108f9c6b
msgid "Since Galette uses a cache system for translations, changes may not be visible immediately; you may have to restart PHP (or to clear cache). It is important to take the original string verbatim, punctuation included; and take care to escape single quotes (with a backslash) in all the strings."
msgstr ""
"Ker Galette za prevode uporablja sistem predpomnilnika, spremembe morda ne "
"bodo takoj vidne; morda boste morali znova zagnati PHP (ali počistiti "
"predpomnilnik). Pomembno je, da izvirni niz vzamete dobesedno, vključno z "
"ločili; in pazite, da v vseh nizih uporabite enojne narekovaje (z obračalno "
"poševnico)."

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:43
#: f928d85c3e2b44b7a87ecc7c848eb051
msgid "You also can override langs for plugins using the same method, just place the file in plugins lang directory and name it ``{plugin}_{mylang}_local_lang.php`` where `{plugin}` is the routing name you can find in the ``_define.php`` file."
msgstr ""
"Jezike za vtičnike lahko prepišete tudi z metodo sam. Datoteko preprosto "
"postavite v imenik z jeziki vtičnikov in jo poimenujte ``{plugin}_{mylang}"
"_local_lang.php``, kjer je `{plugin}` ime usmerjanja, ki ga najdete v "
"datoteki ``_define.php``."

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:45
#: ae27f3e2e3fa4b67ad6fb55a30d83d00
msgid "This will work only if you use Galette translation features, and not with native gettext."
msgstr ""
"To bo delovalo le, če uporabljate prevajalske funkcije Galette in ne z "
"izvornim gettextom."

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:48
#: 175f39314197485ea541b80324e86e63
msgid "Change session lifetime"
msgstr "Spremeni življenjsko dobo seje"

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:50
#: be24dd1f3fa94b5dacee5b25f1adecf7
msgid "Per default, Galette will create session with default lifetime duration (and it seems browsers acts differently in this case). You can anyways define a constant named ``GALETTE_TIMEOUT`` to change session lifetime using :ref:`behavior configuration <behavior>`:"
msgstr ""
"Galette bo privzeto ustvaril sejo s privzetim trajanjem življenjske dobe (in "
"zdi se, da brskalniki v tem primeru delujejo drugače). Vseeno lahko "
"definirate konstanto z imenom ``GALETTE_TIMEOUT``, da spremenite življenjsko "
"dobo seje z uporabo :ref:`behavior configuration <behavior>`:"

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:60
#: 009f4a8642bc41fd8de77df9776d4481
msgid "Log IP addresses behind a proxy"
msgstr "Beleženje IP-naslovov za posredniškim strežnikom"

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:62
#: 0dffc6fdd7c84dc1aafb69b6e91bcc94
msgid "If your Galette instance is behind a proxy, IP address stored in history will be the proxy one, and not the user one :("
msgstr ""
"Če je vaš primerek Galette za posredniškim strežnikom, bo v zgodovini "
"shranjen IP naslov posredniškega strežnika in ne uporabniški :("

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:64
#: 58bf33403a6545b389d880de8c5aa65d
msgid "To fix that, use :ref:`behavior configuration <behavior>` to create a constant named ``GALETTE_X_FORWARDED_FOR_INDEX`` like:"
msgstr ""
"Če želite to popraviti, uporabite :ref:`behavior configuration <behavior>`, "
"da ustvarite konstanto z imenom ``GALETTE_X_FORWARDED_FOR_INDEX``, kot je ta:"

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:71
#: 812bdb7b79fc42f28edbefc5cf583291
msgid "Each proxy server will add its own address on the list, example above will work only if there is only one proxy server."
msgstr ""
"Vsak proxy strežnik bo na seznam dodal svoj naslov, zgornji primer bo "
"deloval le, če je samo en proxy strežnik."

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:75
#: f47cf8b5248649f09a8b5c6627e4c267
msgid "For security reasons, do not use this if your instance is not behind a proxy!"
msgstr ""
"Zaradi varnostnih razlogov tega ne uporabljajte, če vaš primerek ni za "
"proxyjem!"

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:78
#: b63fb714b73140d58f8bddce5af80d2d
msgid "External stats"
msgstr "Zunanja statistika"

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:82
#: 8bcd105d1b614a57ad7ebfc1bbc88516
msgid "Many statistics platforms rely on an extra  Javascript block to work. You can create a ``tracking.js`` file under ``webroot/themes/default`` directory, it will be automatically included."
msgstr ""
"Številne statistične platforme za delovanje potrebujejo dodaten blok "
"Javascript. Datoteko ``tracking.js`` lahko ustvarite v imeniku ``webroot/"
"themes/default``, ki bo samodejno vključena."

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:84
#: 28fb00fb44184a929e34b7a788048b05
msgid "Galette uses Javascript to work. If the code you add in the ``tracking.js`` file is incorrect, this may break Galette!"
msgstr ""
"Galette za delovanje uporablja Javascript. Če je koda, ki jo dodate v "
"datoteko ``tracking.js``, napačna, lahko to povzroči okvaro Galette!"

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:87
#: 9c1b46e7a978430b869f0c6e3262fce2
msgid "CSV exports"
msgstr "Izvozi CSV"

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:91
#: 26b582832b4a4024a4aab9de0b8af0d1
msgid "You can setup parameted exports with a `YAML <https://yaml.org/>`_ file instead of an XML one."
msgstr ""
"Izvoz parametrov lahko nastavite z datoteko `YAML <https://yaml.org/>`_ "
"namesto z datoteko XML."

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:93
#: 2820fa30b5634d628a933ee340294131
msgid "Galette provides a parameted CSV exports system. Only one parameted export is provided, but you can add your own to the ``config/exports.yaml`` file."
msgstr ""
"Galette ponuja sistem za parametriziran izvoz CSV. Na voljo je samo en "
"parametriziran izvoz, vendar lahko v datoteko ``config/exports.yaml`` dodate "
"svojega."

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:97
#: 638f77d6c9424d2dadc5dc2122b90398
msgid "Legacy XML configuration file is still supported; if a duplicate identifier is found, YAML file takes precedence."
msgstr ""
"Starejša konfiguracijska datoteka XML je še vedno podprta; če je najden "
"podvojen identifikator, ima prednost datoteka YAML."

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:99
#: 4986fbad39154b4aab68c8c771a72453
msgid "Let's examine existing \"cotisations\" parameted export:"
msgstr "Oglejmo si obstoječe parametrizirane izvozne storitve \"kotizacije\":"

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:123
#: 76e592ed04ec4c1095ec565b9d31f587
msgid "each array entry is a unique identifier, lowercase without spaces or special character"
msgstr ""
"Vsak vnos v polje je enolični identifikator, napisan z malimi črkami brez "
"presledkov ali posebnih znakov"

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:124
#: 2d6b845ad14c4aceaa3e365456bb4566
msgid "`name` and `description` are mandatory as used to display each parameted export in the user interface"
msgstr ""
"Polja `name` in `description` sta obvezna, saj se uporabljata za prikaz "
"vsakega parametriziranega izvoza v uporabniškem vmesniku"

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:125
#: c655c88551534b388034f10660c4f032
msgid "`filename` sets the filename for output file"
msgstr "`filename` nastavi ime datoteke za izhodno datoteko"

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:126
#: 2b65d20e45d84285b1e8c6a6b0d1d39d
msgid "`query` is the query to execute, it's mandatory. There is no other limitation than the SQL engine ones, expect you cannot send them any parameters"
msgstr ""
"`query` je poizvedba, ki jo je treba izvesti, je obvezna. Ni drugih omejitev "
"razen omejitev mehanizma SQL, razen da jim ne morete poslati nobenih "
"parametrov"

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:127
#: db6af6d37fd846d68983f7ce94f08e78
msgid "`headers` manages columns titles:"
msgstr "`headers` upravlja naslove stolpcev:"

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:129
#: 1b1da00e44084f5d851b162335747a37
msgid "like in the above example, an array of columns titles of your own"
msgstr "kot v zgornjem primeru, polje z lastnimi naslovi stolpcev"

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:130
#: f4148065b88f4d8795b29bed86281c06
msgid "if not present, Galette fields names will be exported. You can use named columns in your SQL query (``SELECT nom_adh AS \"Column title\" FROM ...``)"
msgstr ""
"Če ni prisotno, bodo imena polj Galette izvožena. V poizvedbi SQL lahko "
"uporabite poimenovane stolpce (``SELECT nom_adh AS \"Naslov stolpca\" FROM "
"...``)"

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:131
#: 55d1a44d2ab04494896b755aac0fce46
msgid "set to false (``headers: false``) to disable column headers output"
msgstr ""
"nastavite na false (``headers: false``), da onemogočite izpis glav stolpcev"

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:133
#: c084f79e4dbe4d39b2e0f3995d53a966
msgid "`separator` is the CSV separator that will be used. Possible values are:"
msgstr "`separator` je ločilo CSV, ki bo uporabljeno. Možne vrednosti so:"

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:135
#: c6c260f76c434d5ca47377d23214939c
msgid "semicolon (``;``) - default"
msgstr "podpičje (``;``) - privzeto"

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:136
#: d05d902a5c47491f8b83074efbf64a35
msgid "comma (``,``)"
msgstr "vejica (``,``)"

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:137
#: e5f2b9d1fa62489387935e409eb24695
msgid "tabulation character (``\\t``)"
msgstr "znak za tabelacijo (``\\t``)"

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:139
#: e571bc8e9a774e1b9b2cd14d40d7b603
msgid "`quote` either double quote - default - or simple quote character"
msgstr "`quote` bodisi dvojni narekovaj – privzeto – bodisi preprost narekovaj"

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:140
#: 88168b2860a84585b0892da957c03d16
msgid "to disable an export, you can add ``inactive: true``"
msgstr "Če želite onemogočiti izvoz, lahko dodate ``inactive: true``"

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:145
#: dc42621488b548eeb7e07095bd7b6751
msgid "Administration tools"
msgstr "Orodja za upravljanje"

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:149
#: 2a99707e02094b5398e801b4d43e7bc2
msgid "All the admin tools operations are destructive, use them with caution, and **make sure you did a database backup** before!"
msgstr ""
"Vse operacije skrbniških orodij so uničujoče, uporabljajte jih previdno in "
"**prepričajte se, da ste pred tem naredili varnostno kopijo baze podatkov**!"

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:151
#: 1c578f9418ed4d4b83b002c7d5c1ec12
msgid "There are a few tools provided for Galette admin that permits to:"
msgstr "Za skrbnika Galette je na voljo nekaj orodij, ki omogočajo:"

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:153
#: 619acd95b45e475b9bd2b6e1b582f6da
msgid "**reinitialize mailings contents** will reset all emails contents to default values,"
msgstr ""
"**ponovna inicializacija vsebine e-poštnih sporočil** ponastavi vsebino vseh "
"e-poštnih sporočil na privzete vrednosti,"

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:154
#: 3032f80400cb4c2591dc166a2fb1a4a2
msgid "**reinitialize fields configuration** will reset all members core fields to their default value. This does not imply dynamic fields,"
msgstr ""
"**Konfiguracija ponovne inicializacije polj** bo ponastavila vsa osnovna "
"polja članov na privzete vrednosti. To ne pomeni dinamičnih polj,"

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:155
#: feabe0c1c39c4fad927c3e0aa5fadaf3
msgid "**reinitialize PDF models** will reset all PDF models to default values,"
msgstr ""
"**Ponovna inicializacija modelov PDF** bo ponastavila vse modele PDF na "
"privzete vrednosti,"

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:156
#: 88ed7f55ed2c4fab90a780919349b47d
msgid "**generate empty logins and passwords** those information are required to improve security, but sometimes missing (if you import a CSV for example). This feature will set random values as login and password fields that would be empty in database."
msgstr ""
"**generiraj prazna uporabniška imena in gesla**. Ti podatki so potrebni za "
"izboljšanje varnosti, vendar včasih manjkajo (na primer, če uvozite datoteko "
"CSV). Ta funkcija bo nastavila naključne vrednosti kot polja za prijavo in "
"geslo, ki bi bila v zbirki podatkov prazna."

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:157
#: 43304efcd2b14338b8ada3638077f2ab
msgid "**Fix dynamic fields dates format** will convert all dynamic fields dates to the new format (see :ref:`dynamic fields <dynamic_fields>`)."
msgstr ""
"**Popravi obliko datumov dinamičnih polj** bo pretvorila vse datume "
"dinamičnih polj v novo obliko (glejte :ref:`dynamic fields <dynamic_fields>`)"
"."

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:162
#: d8edd5f7d98e4b12b1078f5ea0ac024d
msgid "Galette modes"
msgstr "Galettejevi načini"

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:164
#: e2055e48ed054f34aa542de29b59583f
msgid "Several modes are provided in Galette you can configure with ``GALETTE_MODE`` constant (:ref:`see Galette behavior configuration <behavior>`). This directive can take the following values:"
msgstr ""
"V Galette je na voljo več načinov, ki jih lahko konfigurirate s konstanto "
"``GALETTE_MODE`` (:ref:`glejte konfiguracija vedenja Galette <behavior>`). "
"Ta direktiva lahko sprejme naslednje vrednosti:"

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:166
#: ef4616e506c940c28f23c8482a5d80ef
msgid "``PROD``: production mode (non production instance should be on another mode). This is the default mode for releases, but it may change in development branch."
msgstr ""
"``PROD``: produkcijski način (neprodukcijski primerek mora biti v drugem "
"načinu). To je privzeti način za izdaje, vendar se lahko v razvojni veji "
"spremeni."

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:167
#: edd8fc6e54bd4573b29a3b4f3a42fcff
msgid "``DEMO``: demonstration mode, the same as ``PROD`` but with some features disabled like sending emails, modifying superadmin data, ..."
msgstr ""
"``DEMO``: demonstracijski način, enak kot ``PROD``, vendar z nekaterimi "
"onemogočenimi funkcijami, kot so pošiljanje e-pošte, spreminjanje podatkov "
"superadministratorja, ..."

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:168
#: 58edd5fb363441bb8b6c16e611bca56a
msgid "``TEST``: reserved for unit tests."
msgstr "``TEST``: rezervirano za enotne teste."

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:169
#: 53fad056e86c433cb702eb054bfa3c32
msgid "``MAINT``: maintenance mode. Only super admin will be able to login."
msgstr ""
"``MAINT``: vzdrževalni način. Prijavil se bo lahko samo super administrator."

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:174
#: b61851b56ee84b698065555decc5b03d
msgid "Galette Debug"
msgstr "Odpravljanje napak v Galette"

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:178
#: ce4fe39f0d024bd7b29ff27257538228
msgid "A dedicated constant name ``GALETTE_DEBUG`` can be used to enable debug mode. With this mode on:"
msgstr ""
"Za omogočanje načina za odpravljanje napak se lahko uporabi namenska "
"konstanta z imenom ``GALETTE_DEBUG``. Ko je ta način vklopljen:"

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:180
#: 009a52199c584e54ae7156c1a22ac0f5
msgid "unstable/not finished parts will be activated,"
msgstr "aktivirani bodo nestabilni/nedokončani deli,"

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:181
#: a73bd7b04767463897f20306f1e84873
msgid "some data will not be stored in session,"
msgstr "nekateri podatki ne bodo shranjeni med sejo,"

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:182
#: a25b4b21b8c24e15952363a73165be58
msgid "default log level is set to ``DEBUG``,"
msgstr "privzeta raven dnevnika je nastavljena na ``DEBUG``,"

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:183
#: 56cb2c250ab246c1838e90719c47bf10
msgid "news won't be cached,"
msgstr "novice ne bodo shranjene v predpomnilnik,"

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:184
#: ccd4bd9fae2d4456b4e5496ea9372f16
msgid "database version check will not be done."
msgstr "Preverjanje različice baze podatkov ne bo opravljeno."

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:190
#: 49b49d1f899b4984ab40f99592260c37
msgid "Behavior configuration"
msgstr "Konfiguracija vedenja"

#: ../usermanual/avancee.rst:192
#: 582fcfa42dcf4f25ba5d25e867335d2c
msgid "It is possible to change some of Galette behaviors:"
msgstr "Nekatera vedenja Galette je mogoče spremeniti:"

